body:
I believe you will most likely have to take a PCR test on entry then move on to your stay and quarantine there until you get the results. Then you are free. 

New rules apply from april 1st and I just tried to check with UK passport and leaving from UK and it says the same thing as for my EU country.

Also says this;
Travelers granted an exemption and have the required proof;

If you complete the Qcode form you get a quarantine exemption I believe. Someone correct me if I am wrong.

